sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a<br>Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request CSMS to get data for:<br>- OCPPCommCtrlr.OfflineThreshold<br>- AuthCtrlr.AuthorizeRemoteStart

    CSMS->>CS: GetVariablesRequest (OCPPCommCtrlr.OfflineThreshold, AuthCtrlr.AuthorizeRemoteStart)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: GetVariablesRequest with (in arbitrary order)<br>getVariableData[0]:<br>- attributeType is at least absent or attributeType = Actual, but Target, MinSet, and MaxSet are also allowed<br>- variable.name = "OfflineThreshold"<br>- component.name = "OCPPCommCtrlr"<br>getVariableData[1]:<br>- attributeType is at least absent or attributeType = Actual, but Target, MinSet, and MaxSet are also allowed<br>- variable.name = "AuthorizeRemoteStart"<br>- component.name = "AuthCtrlr"

    CS-->>CSMS: GetVariablesResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validation: Manually validate that CSMS has correctly read the requested variables
